### =====================================================
### 2FA Disable - POST /account/2fa/disable
### Desactiva TODOS los métodos 2FA del usuario;
### requiere confirmar la contraseña
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Desactivar 2FA con contraseña correcta (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 2: Sin token — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 3: Campo requerido faltante (sin password) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
